# Hi, I'm Amos Adebo 👋

### Manufacturing & Operations Professional | Data Analytics

I combine hands-on manufacturing and operations experience with developing capability in **Excel, SQL, KPI analysis and management-oriented dashboarding**.

My analytics focus is practical: using data to understand operational performance, downtime, quality and HSE signals and turn business questions into structured analysis.

## Featured project

### Dry-Fruit Manufacturing Operations Performance & HSE Analytics

A **simulated manufacturing analytics case study** covering:

- 540 synthetic production records
- KPI development and validation
- Excel analysis
- SQL analysis
- machine / shift / product interaction analysis
- executive, operations and HSE dashboards
- evidence-controlled recommendations and limitations

🔗 **Live case study:** https://amosadebor.github.io/dry-fruit-manufacturing-analytics/

🔗 **Repository:** https://github.com/amosadebor/dry-fruit-manufacturing-analytics

> **Disclosure:** The project uses synthetic data. Findings are illustrative and do not represent actual employer performance.

